<title>CHINA: Heilongjiang 96 net surges 48 pct.</title>
<headline>Heilongjiang 96 net surges 48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		    296.74	 vs	   278.890</p>
<p> Net profit		  124.92	 vs	    84.161</p>
<p> Net asset per share     1.98 yuan    vs	    1.54 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	0.40 yuan    vs	    0.41 yuan</p>
<p>(The company listed its B shares on April 22, 1996)</p>
<p>Company name: Heilongjiang Electric Power Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: The results were published in a company statement. The net profit is based on international accounting standards, other figures are based on domestic accounting standards.</p>
<p>Based on domestic accounting standards, the 1996 net profit was 125.28 million yuan against 83.038 million yuan in 1995.</p>
</text>
